Add a global keyboard host so number pads can close by tapping outside
or by ×/完了. Strength workouts now store multiple exercises with
per-set weight and reps. The food form shows a camera scan action
immediately instead of hiding it behind an expand row.

Co-authored-by: naruto.futuree <naruto.futuree@gmail.com>
